  "notable_quotes": [
    "The Cu2+/Fe3+ LODs of BUT-26 are the lowest among reported MOF sensors and far below US-EPA/WHO drinking-water limits.",
    "BUT-26 was obtained from 2D BUT-25 by a single-crystal-to-single-crystal transformation into a 3D layer-pillared MOF.",
    "BUT-26 is a highly sensitive aqueous sensor, with LODs of 0.12 mM for Cu2+ and 0.10 mM for Fe3+."
